    <title>Attention is All You Really Need</title>
    <summary>We propose a new architecture, the Transformer-Plus, which extends
the original Transformer model with additional attention heads and longer
context windows. Our experiments show consistent improvements over baselines
on a variety of NLP benchmarks.</summary>
